  "question": {
    "text": "A stone is projected from the ground with velocity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50&nbsp;</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> at an angle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn><mo>°</mo></math> with horizontal. It crosses a wall after <math><mn>3</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>s</mn><mo>.</mo></math> How far beyond the wall the stone will strike the ground? <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>&nbsp;</mi></math>"
  },
